{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If you see an object, approach it, grab it, process it, and move to a designated location, otherwise scan area or stop. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDesignatedLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = StopAndWait    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
